==Battleground==
*5 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
*5 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Lophiiformes Angaburu]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*12 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Casaurian Darkjo]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[St. Dober]] spawns.
**Infinite [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**2 [[Lophiiformes Angaburu]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 53.33~56.67 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,700f</sup>.
**5 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**1 [[Crustaceous Scissorex]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage can be really challenging, the goal is to kill St. Dober as fast as possible, even if the other enemies are big threats, St. Dober will rapidly advance while he wipes all of your units every few seconds with surges.

A combination of [[Talents|Talented]] [[Awakened Bahamut Cat]], [[Mushroom Cat]], [[Talents|Talented]] [[Pizza Cat]] and other high damage units can be used to burst down St. Dober before losing too much ground. If you manage to kill St. Dober fast enough you can deal with Casaurian Darkjo and the other Behemoths after.

If possesed, the [[True Form]]s of the Uncanny Legends [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cats]] perform great here due to their [[Behemoth Slayer]] and high overall stats, altough they are obtained close to the end of [[Uncanny Legends]], upon completion of [[Atonement for Sin]].

